{"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.062674485134713187,"t":"Test 7","c":1,"w":0.062717208862304696,"x":0.86157951202769101,"h":0.016330494335879964},{"w":0.74294057210286457,"y":0.10594381331751834,"t":"Sometimes, of course, conflict does occur, and can get out of hand. In such cases the human","x":0.082230826198575357,"c":1,"h":0.018712170694124342},{"x":0.080180482982972312,"t":"resources department often gets involved. However, if one of the parties in a conflict sees.","c":1,"w":0.7203303019205729,"h":0.018558388183198327,"y":0.12101392405995426},{"h":0.016484563286088272,"w":0.73262964884440107,"y":0.1380550606982901,"c":1,"x":0.080189420842444861,"t":"human resources as simply a mouthpiece for the chief executive, then an external mediator"},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.15400471131790894,"t":"might be able to help. By talking to both sides, and trying to find the truth of what's been","x":0.0802469169162012,"c":1,"w":0.69958847045898431},{"h":0.020014476439135676,"w":0.72655878702799481,"y":0.16718466870472137,"t":"happening, they can build a clear picture of the situation, and give feedback that both sides","c":1,"x":0.080131416272255174},{"x":0.080246909395269531,"y":0.18459302310803749,"w":0.41563786824544274,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"will accept, precisely because they're independent."},{"x":0.83539094598214314,"w":0.04115226427714036,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"t":"Q40","y":0.12209302297890079},{"w":0.10710886637369793,"x":0.40323569016718502,"t":"TEST 7","h":0.02064728259478632,"y":0.23967635868020154,"c":1},{"y":0.30087209285473238,"t":"SECTION 1","x":0.080246910808648028,"h":0.017443572674538999,"c":1,"w":0.15637860616048177},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.33284883707953206,"x":0.078189300725196531,"t":"SUSIE:","w":0.049382715225219725},{"w":0.043209877014160167,"h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.078189300073166823,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.34883720918667016},{"x":0.15843621538846189,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Hello?","y":0.32994186030543127,"w":0.059670778910318995,"c":1},{"t":"Hi, Susie, it's Paul here. How are you? Enjoying your new job? You're working at","h":0.021640095750069643,"c":1,"y":0.3440058691373814,"w":0.64437754313151041,"x":0.1602906316555924},{"t":"the library, aren't you?","x":0.16049382697912146,"w":0.18106995900472006,"y":0.36189634874169907,"h":0.014557139752750747,"c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.080246913236747069,"y":0.37936046501610754,"t":"SUSIE:","w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1},{"t":"PAUL:","y":0.39389534868426745,"x":0.078189299805874288,"c":1,"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"y":0.40967685940349752,"t":"SUSIE:","c":1,"w":0.047525618871053055,"h":0.01204162997547964,"x":0.078089042309240519},{"t":"Yes. I started when the library re-opened a month ago. It's great.","h":0.016822493118447968,"c":1,"x":0.16038684674840417,"w":0.51461776733398434,"y":0.37600632663179478},{"h":0.014534883982160629,"c":1,"t":"Actually Carol and I have been meaning to join for a while.","x":0.16049383158644748,"y":0.39244186032563833,"w":0.4691357930501302},{"w":0.60299596150716139,"h":0.01745705554005117,"c":1,"x":0.16043635834863607,"y":0.40694109840417192,"t":"Oh, you should. It doesn't cost anything, and the new library has all sorts of"},{"c":1,"t":"facilities. It's not just a place where you borrow books. For instance, there's an","x":0.15836082853939595,"y":0.42270306488045484,"w":0.62566518147786465,"h":0.017971920602032343},{"t":"area with comfortable seats where you can sit and read the magazines they have","w":0.64838363647460939,"x":0.16037510397065413,"y":0.43681564200509437,"h":0.018978735583409789,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"there. Some people spend the whole morning there.","h":0.016569684616106861,"x":0.16037582010434895,"y":0.45319774650888789,"w":0.41794479370117188},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"PAUL:","w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1,"x":0.076131686904442553,"y":0.47093023242304755},{"y":0.48691860453295732,"t":"SUSIE:","h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.078189300283604282,"w":0.045267489751180001,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","x":0.078189299857314626,"y":0.50290697664401451,"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"w":0.38477366129557294,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. Wish I had that amount of time to spend!","x":0.15843621451454898,"y":0.4693757360124966,"h":0.014723203769140047},{"w":0.58847737630208341,"y":0.48546511614490939,"x":0.1604938219934931,"t":"Yes, you must be pretty busy at present, with the children and everything?","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.65432098388671878,"x":0.15843621547674938,"t":"We are, yes. But we're hoping to get away this summer. We're thinking of going to","y":0.49999999984645382,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"w":0.068819122314453085,"t":"Greece.","x":0.15999245840493523,"c":1,"h":0.013522892874458292,"y":0.51642693859264788},{"t":"SUSIE:","x":0.078189300289019048,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.53343023244358512,"c":1,"w":0.045267489751180015},{"t":"Well, we've got a much laraer section of the library devoted to travel books now, soQ1","y":0.53052325603206774,"x":0.15843621039807998,"c":1,"w":0.69958847045898442,"h":0.016002068109590928},{"x":0.15837450958321539,"w":0.6544468688964844,"h":0.01702259566955211,"c":1,"y":0.54575499256039295,"t":"you should come and have a look. I can't remember if there's anything specifically"},{"x":0.15843621153210022,"c":1,"t":"on Greece, but I should think so.","y":0.56242638384334354,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.26543210347493496},{"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.57994186036379736,"w":0.039094651540120429,"x":0.078189299641462415},{"y":0.5764983276952419,"w":0.65250783284505209,"x":0.16035905045597929,"h":0.017911079775177807,"c":1,"t":"OK. Now Carol's organising a project for the history class she teaches at school -"},{"t":"it's about life in the town a hundred years ago. Do you have anything that might be","x":0.15835783429419015,"y":0.59270093798441204,"h":0.017377299049296524,"c":1,"w":0.65652282714843746},{"w":0.04740162531534832,"t":"SUSIE:","y":0.62634870738075499,"h":0.0089304921764647993,"c":1,"x":0.076093425927075048},{"x":0.074074073735718268,"c":1,"y":0.65697674407039097,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.043209877014160181,"t":"PAUL:"},{"y":0.70307003809440782,"t":"SUSIE:","w":0.045576060612996419,"x":0.075977401678327061,"h":0.009557598190397476,"c":1},{"y":0.74999999989982846,"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1,"x":0.074074073519866057,"t":"PAUL:"},{"c":1,"y":0.76453488359001098,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"SUSIE:","w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.072016461003374818},{"t":"PAUL:","x":0.072016460566993998,"w":0.043209877014160167,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463,"y":0.81104651151225149},{"c":1,"y":0.84996476646223706,"t":"SUSIE:","h":0.0093727926202600287,"x":0.073952615579538111,"w":0.045510406494140634},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.074074073304013846,"y":0.86627906966612289,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","w":0.039094651540120429},{"w":0.047381916046142572,"y":0.88073638872190574,"c":1,"h":0.008876059726494856,"t":"SUSIE:","x":0.071988054224274248},{"x":0.15631457052456596,"w":0.70177342732747394,"h":0.016660866664351848,"t":"Yes, actually we've now got a new section with materials on the history of the town. Q2","c":1,"y":0.62327866327017356},{"h":0.015241063525735732,"y":0.63920183095968774,"x":0.15621217778179111,"c":1,"w":0.19383113861083986,"t":"and surrounding region."},{"w":0.65448481241861978,"h":0.017158801479811414,"y":0.65360674641874539,"c":1,"t":"Right. I'Il tell her. You can't always find that sort of thing on the internet. Now in the","x":0.1583535337257381},{"t":"old library there used to be a separate room with reference books. It was a really","h":0.016043156420524673,"w":0.64197530110677081,"y":0.67005813938773118,"x":0.15843621762249568,"c":1},{"w":0.13168724060058593,"t":"nice quiet room.","h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"y":0.6860465115068034,"x":0.15843621492604446},{"x":0.15637859813908486,"t":"Yes. We've put those books in the main part of the library now, but we do have","h":0.016039732066986834,"y":0.70053003551413373,"c":1,"w":0.62757202148437508},{"t":"Q3","h":0.014534882858869391,"c":1,"y":0.70203488397027469,"x":0.8292181068903417,"w":0.02880658467610675},{"x":0.15637859608308285,"w":0.63991770426432293,"y":0.71643109530439708,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"a room called the community room. It can be hired out for meetings, but at other"},{"y":0.73124868835967216,"t":"times people can use it to study.","c":1,"x":0.15619870095351046,"w":0.25961542765299478,"h":0.015959310587780773},{"t":"I might use that. It's hard to find anywhere quiet at home sometimes.","y":0.7470989075193899,"w":0.54953094482421871,"h":0.016011768291639639,"x":0.15630436817659055,"c":1},{"x":0.15432099904012414,"w":0.7016460673014322,"t":"I can't remember how old your son and daughter are... we've introduced a special. Q4","h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.76295641950795345},{"y":0.77739697031402999,"t":"section of fiction written specially for teenagers, but they might be a bit young for","w":0.64619410196940108,"x":0.15427147741663266,"h":0.017024851238488847,"c":1},{"x":0.15432098754210544,"t":"that?","y":0.79360465102922872,"w":0.045267489751180001,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"h":0.017599739371255918,"c":1,"t":"Yes, they would be.","x":0.15400659565408673,"w":0.16315059661865236,"y":0.8080036547864059},{"c":1,"x":0.15423088461429632,"y":0.84732195431779234,"w":0.43845921834309898,"t":"Well, we do have lots of activities for younger children.","h":0.016583543784205568},{"y":0.86337209287299865,"x":0.15432098732110922,"t":"Yes?","w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.62770833333333331,"t":"For example we have a Science Club. At the next meeting, they're going to be","x":0.15425544853636089,"h":0.016439434496337113,"c":1,"y":0.87787692178517474},{"t":"doing experiments with stuff that everyone has in the kitchen - sugar and flour and","h":0.017089188871170169,"w":0.66063420613606771,"c":1,"x":0.1542428132407008,"y":0.89321502982951684},{"t":"so on.","c":1,"y":0.91133720917140626,"w":0.053497943878173831,"x":0.15637859995578776,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"c":1,"t":"Example","y":0.3793093737578026,"h":0.013183578023921783,"x":0.83331480293269167,"w":0.072053521474202409},{"c":1,"t":"105","x":0.87242798276903422,"w":0.039094651540120484,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.9360465114545421},{"y":0.96641811852927229,"c":1,"w":0.2085117212931315,"h":0.017806331737864278,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39471442585841338}],"w":2400}